    <question_explanation no="5" id="PRB-74DF4635B29A561E-Q5">
      <question_stem>문법적으로 옳은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>문법적</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Je me lave les mains.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 불어 · 대명동사와 신체 부위
정답은 ②이다. 대명동사로 자신의 신체 부위를 씻을 때는 소유형용사 대신 정관사를 써서 Je me lave les mains라고 한다. 대명동사의 복합과거는 être를 조동사로 쓴다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Je lui lave ses mains.</choice_text>
          <commentary>소유형용사와 lui가 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Je me lave les mains.</choice_text>
          <commentary>Je me lave les mains이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Je me lave mes mains.</choice_text>
          <commentary>소유형용사가 중복되었다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Je m'ai lavé les mains.</choice_text>
          <commentary>조동사는 être이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="6" id="PRB-74DF4635B29A561E-Q6">
      <question_stem>괄호 안에 들어갈 동사 avoir의 활용형이 나머지 셋과 다른 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>괄호</keyword>
        <keyword>동사</keyword>
        <keyword>활용형</keyword>
        <keyword>나머지</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Si elle était plus jeune, elle ( ) plus de chances.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 불어 · avoir의 활용
정답은 ④이다. Il faut que, vouloir que, bien que 뒤에는 접속법이 오므로 avoir의 접속법 현재 ait가 들어간다. Si + 반과거의 주절에는 조건법 현재 aurait가 온다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Il faut qu'elle ( ) de l'argent.</choice_text>
          <commentary>접속법 ait이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Vous voudriez qu'elle ( ) raison ?</choice_text>
          <commentary>접속법 ait이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Bien qu'elle ( ) peur, elle ne dit rien.</choice_text>
          <commentary>접속법 ait이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Si elle était plus jeune, elle ( ) plus de chances.</choice_text>
          <commentary>조건법 aurait이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
