      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 불어 · prendre ses jambes à son cou
정답은 ①이다. prendre ses jambes à son cou는 '걸음아 날 살려라 하고 달아나다'라는 관용 표현이므로 a pris la fuite(도망쳤다)와 같다.</overall_commentary>
      <passage_evidence>Un détenu a bousculé un policier et a pris ses jambes à son cou.</passage_evidence>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>a pris la fuite.</choice_text>
          <commentary>a pris la fuite이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>a été immédiatement arrêté.</choice_text>
          <commentary>체포된 것이 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>s'est blessé aux jambes et au cou.</choice_text>
          <commentary>다친 것이 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>a marché sur les jambes du policier.</choice_text>
          <commentary>다리를 밟은 것이 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
