        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Celle-là celui-ci</choice_text>
          <commentary>지시 관계가 반대이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Celui-ci celle-là</choice_text>
          <commentary>성이 맞지 않다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Celle-ci celui-là</choice_text>
          <commentary>Celle-ci, celui-là이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
